Modification time stamp: 06.02.25-13:41:50
History id: 2.009
Comment:
A new option has been added for the selection of the north-south plays in
the final game tree. The option '-v' selects the play in which north-south
win the tricks as soon as possible and where the use of outside entries
is minimized.

