Affected modules:

   create_boards.c - sid: 1.7
==========================================
Modification time stamp: 15.10.25-10:13:36
History id: 2.016
Comment:
We added alternatives for the order in which the game tree is folded.
UP		start at the last branch and work upwards;
UPSTRIDE	start at the last branch and work upwards with equal strides;
DOWN		start at the first branch and work downwards;
DOWNSTRIDE	start at the first branch and work downwards with equal strides.

Affected modules:

   fold_tree.c - sid: 1.3
==========================================
Modification time stamp: 17.02.26-15:26:18
History id: 2.017
Comment:
The fold mode of the final tree is entered with parameter -m{U|US|D|DS}. The default is mode DOWN.

